sequenceDiagram
  participant Job as Synthetic job
  participant OTel as Collector
  participant Raw as Eventhouse raw tables
  participant MV as Materialized views
  participant KQL as KQL functions
  participant G as Grafana
  Job->>OTel: OTLP/HTTP JSON: 4 service spans, 1 log, 2 metric points
  OTel-->>Job: OTLP acknowledgement (not ingestion proof)
  OTel->>OTel: Filter, transform, batch
  OTel->>Raw: Export using managed identity
  Raw->>MV: Incremental minute-level aggregation
  G->>KQL: Time-bounded overview queries
  KQL->>MV: Query view + unmaterialized delta
  KQL-->>G: Counts, errors, approximate percentiles
  G->>Raw: TraceID detail query
  Raw-->>G: Related log and four-service span chain, Run ID
